  "typicalTrace": {
    "caseId": "CASE-207",
    "runIndex": 1,
    "diagnosis": "REL-207's catalog_result_cap_v2 QueryPolicy change truncates lower-ranked catalog results for RETURNING users, causing catalog_result_depth to drop sharply.",
    "rootCauseScore": "2",
    "actions": [
      {
        "sequence": 1,
        "decisionType": "CREATE_HYPOTHESES",
        "rationale": "Release RISK-207 correlates with REPL-207 full rollout at 09:00, with metric drop from 10:00 onward for RETURNING users. Feature flag and QueryPolicy change are prime suspects, but I will also consider metric instrumentation artifacts and upstream ranking failures to avoid prematurely committing to a single cause."
      },
      {
        "sequence": 2,
        "decisionType": "CALL_TOOL",
        "rationale": "查询 RETURNING 用户在发布前后细粒度时间序列，验证下降是否恰好在 REL-207 发布后开始、值是否机械固定、以及是否有预发布迹象，从而区分 Release 变更、指标误报和下游故障。"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 3,
        "decisionType": "ASSESS_EVIDENCE",
        "rationale": "评估来自 query_metric 的当前待处理证据，它记录了 RETURNING 用户中 catalog_result_depth 从基线 40 下降到 10。该观察证实了风险事件度量异常，但没有区分其根因：发布限制、度量错误或下游故障均可能产生同样观察。因此对所有假设评估为 NEUTRAL。"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 4,
        "decisionType": "CALL_TOOL",
        "rationale": "当前仅有中性证据，需判别H1声称的RETURNING特异性。按user_type分组，观察是否仅RETURNING下降，以区分发布变更假设与全局或下游故障假设。"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 5,
        "decisionType": "ASSESS_EVIDENCE",
        "rationale": "EV-7daf81fc 的 segment_metric 结果显示 RETURNING 深度为 10、NEW 深度为 40，影响明确集中于 RETURNING 用户。该证据与 REL-207 变更导致 RETURNING 结果截断的假设一致；对指标误报假设无区分度；同时因异常并非全局扩散而是限定于 RETURNING 分群，与下游服务整体故障假设的预期不符。"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 6,
        "decisionType": "CALL_TOOL",
        "rationale": "区分真实产品截断(H1)与仅指标误报(H2)。若用户反馈确实报告低排名结果丢失，支持H1并反驳H2；若无相关反馈，则倾向于H2。"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 7,
        "decisionType": "ASSESS_EVIDENCE",
        "rationale": "评估用户反馈证据对当前两个活跃假设的影响。反馈仅提及缩略图加载慢，未提及低排名结果缺失，无法支持或反驳发布导致截断，也无法证明或反驳指标误报机制，因此对两个假设均判为 NEUTRAL。"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 8,
        "decisionType": "CALL_TOOL",
        "rationale": "Need to determine whether the reduced catalog_result_depth for RETURNING users is unique to catalog-8.3. If only catalog-8.3 shows the drop, it supports the release-caused cap/QueryPolicy hypothesis; if other app versions show the same drop, it points to a broader metric/reporting issue and would support the instrumentation hypothesis."
      },
      {
        "sequence": 9,
        "decisionType": "CALL_TOOL",
        "rationale": "现有证据将异常锁定在 RETURNING 用户，但缺乏区分真实结果截断(H1)与指标误报(H2)的机制证据。历史相似事故若显示同类 flag 曾导致真实截断则支持 H1，若显示 instrumentation 误报则支持 H2，具有判别力。"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 10,
        "decisionType": "ASSESS_EVIDENCE",
        "rationale": "处理 pending 的历史事故证据，评估其与活跃假设的关系。"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 11,
        "decisionType": "FINALIZE",
        "rationale": "H1 是唯一获得当前事件 SUPPORTS 证据的假设：segment_metric 清晰显示仅 RETURNING 用户深度异常（10 vs NEW 40），与 REL-207 在 09:00 全量发布的 catalog_result_cap_v2 变更时间及 RETURNING 分群预期一致。H3 已因分群矛盾被服务端拒绝；H2 没有任何支持证据且无观测支持 instrumentation bug。app_version 维度查询已返回 EMPTY，工具调用预算已耗尽，无其它可判别 query shape。根据收敛规则，应结束多解并选择 H1，处置建议回滚该变更以止损。"
      }
    ],
